[{"client_msg_id":"b2d75e4c-b1f0-4d4e-be1f-05e6d7d29d68","type":"message","user":"U022T2AQ327","text":"`M-!`も手になじませよう。","ts":"1625391172.357900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VXSd2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e554230e-470e-47dc-a2d4-523e5f73bfd1","type":"message","user":"U022T2AQ327","text":"`M-|` はぼくなぜかそっちの方はときどき使うんですよねー。パイプのイメージがなぜか心にしみついていて。sortするだけならemacsでいいですがさらにいろいろさせたいときとか。","ts":"1625391154.357700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tVom"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4689104c-089d-43e0-83f9-67091c38da45","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"コマンド一個打ちたいとか結構良くあるので `M-!` は便利ですねー。regionを標準入力で入れる `M-|` も便利です。","ts":"1625390728.356600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pcre"}]},{"client_msg_id":"09edce17-8d30-4d4b-a549-bb8a6cfd394c","type":"message","user":"U022T2AQ327","text":"へえmagitが速くなるなら試してみよう \u003chttps://github.com/magit/libegit2\u003e\nmagitは大きいレポジトリのときにかなり遅いので(1ファイルaddするだけで数秒かかったりします)","ts":"1625390680.356200","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"magit/libegit2","id":1,"title":"magit/libegit2","text":"Emacs bindings for libgit2","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"90","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"C","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q24r"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e6114a4d-d91d-4ce8-a380-8564a9738acc","type":"message","user":"U022T2AQ327","text":"conao3氏は日常的に `M-!` を使われているんですねー(↑)。僕も見習ってみよう。どうせターミナルではどんどんコマンドを書いているんだから、Emacsだけ関数化しないといけないなんということはないですもんね。キーバインドを当てないと使わないわけでもないし。\n\nこのあたり、人の操作を見て、自分の操作を見つめなおせるのが交流のいいところだなあ","ts":"1625390388.355200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yCjty"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6dc07d55-85a6-4e8a-ae66-197e4cffd66a","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/magit/libegit2\u003e\nふと思いたってこれを試してみました。","ts":"1625330425.352500","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"magit/libegit2","id":1,"title":"magit/libegit2","text":"Emacs bindings for libgit2","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"90","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"C","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"edited":{"user":"UFHQ7TNT0","ts":"1625330432.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NNPj"}]}]
